OL,3,GNEWSAAward-winning station leaves users
OL,4,Adivided
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoventry railway station has been named
OL,7,Fthe UK's best large station at the
OL,8,FNational Rail Awards, beating rivals
OL,9,Fincluding Nottingham, Milton Keynes
OL,10,FCentral and London St Pancras
OL,11,FInternational.
OL,13,FBut while some passengers have praised
OL,14,Fthe station's transformation in recent
OL,15,Fyears, others believe there is still
OL,16,Froom for improvement.
OL,18,FJudges awarded Coventry railway station
OL,19,Fthe title of Large Station of the Year,
OL,20,Fciting recent investment,
OL,21,Fwell-maintained facilities, retail
OL,22,Foptions and helpful staff.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
